companies in Forbes roundup", "content": "A Forbes survey has named 18 humanoid robot companies it sees as central 
to the current race for commercial deployment, ranging from factory focused startups such as Agility Robotics and 
Apptronik to large manufacturers including Tesla, BYD, Samsung and Toyota. Several of the companies in the Forbes 
list are being judged less on humanoid form factor alone and more on whether the robots are touching real 
