Society.*](https://protect-us.mimecast.com/s/02BlCG6wq3fmpMVpsKwZx8?domain=amazon.co.uk) He has written over 20 
best-selling and award-winning books and advises and coaches many of the\n\n### [The AI Efficiency Trap: Why Doing 
Things Faster Could Cost Companies The 
Future](https://www.forbes.com/sites/bernardmarr/2026/06/01/the-ai-efficiency-trap-why-doing-things-faster-could-co
st-companies-the-future/)\n\nMany companies are using AI to automate tasks, cut costs and speed up existing 
workflows, but that approach risks missing the much bigger opportunity.\n\n### [The 7 AI Agent Guardrails Every 
Business Needs Before Things Go 
Wrong](https://www.forbes.com/sites/bernardmarr/2026/06/03/the-7-ai-agent-guardrails-every-business-needs-before-th
ings-go-wrong/)\n\nAI agents promise to automate work, make decisions and transform business operations, but giving
machines more autonomy also creates new risks.\n\n### [10 Ways Humanoid Robots Are About To Change Everyday 
Life](https://www.forbes.com/sites/bernardmarr/2026/06/05/10-ways-humanoid-robots-are-about-to-change-everyday-life
/)\n\nAs AI makes them smarter and more affordable, human-shaped machines could transform some of the most 
demanding, repetitive & dangerous jobs in business and everyday life.\n\n### [Should You Really Say Please And 
Thank You To 
AI?](https://www.forbes.com/sites/bernardmarr/2026/06/08/should-you-really-say-please-and-thank-you-to-ai/)\n\nMill
ions of people now say please and thank you to AI chatbots, but does politeness actually improve the answers or 
simply waste time and energy?\n\n### [How To Talk To 
AI](https://www.forbes.com/sites/bernardmarr/2026/06/10/how-to-talk-to-ai/)\n\nTalking to AI well is becoming one 
of the most valuable business skills, because better questions lead to better thinking, clearer decisions and 
stronger results.\n\n### [The Physical AI Boom: 11 Companies Building The Next Tech 
Revolution](https://www.forbes.com/sites/bernardmarr/2026/06/12/the-physical-ai-boom-11-companies-building-the-next
-tech-revolution/)\n\nPhysical AI is moving artificial intelligence from screens and software into robots, drones, 
self-driving vehicles and intelligent machines.\n\n### [5 Big AI Failures That Show What Can Go 
Wrong](https://www.forbes.com/sites/bernardmarr/2026/06/15/5-big-ai-failures-that-show-what-can-go-wrong/)\n\nAI 
can transform businesses, but real-world failures at companies including Air Canada, Zillow, Samsung, CNET and IBM 
show how quickly things can go wrong.\n\n### [The Humanoid Robots You Can Actually Buy Right 
Now](https://www.forbes.com/sites/bernardmarr/2026/06/17/the-humanoid-robots-you-can-actually-buy-right-now/)\n\nHu
manoid robots are moving from science fiction into the real world, with several models now available for homes, 
research labs and industrial deployments.\n\n### [Humanoid Robots: 18 Companies Racing To Build The Next Big Thing 
In 
AI](https://www.forbes.com/sites/bernardmarr/2026/06/19/humanoid-robots-18-companies-racing-to-build-the-next-big-t
hing-in-ai/)\n\nFrom Tesla and Boston Dynamics to Figure AI, Unitree, UBTech and 1X, these are the companies 
shaping one of the most exciting new frontiers in robotics.\n\n### [AI Layoffs Are Here, But They Don’t Mean What 
