robotics companies… currently racing to produce machines that can walk, talk, and collaborate with 
humans”。\n\n关键信息与选取标准：\n- 目标：\"This guide aims to introduce mainstream humanoid robotics companies by
2026, covering their main robots, funding situations, pricing, and what makes each company unique.\" 
这表明其**样本并非全体人形机器人公司，而是主流/有代表性的“mainstream”玩家**。\n- 所有列举公司（Tesla、Figure 
AI、Agility Robotics、Unitree、UBTech、1X、Apptronik 等）都围绕具体人形机器人产品（Optimus、Figure 
02、Digit、G1、Walker等）展开，说明**条件之一是拥有实物人形机器人**，且用于工业、物流或家庭场景。\n- 
文中用多个聚焦指标做对比：\n  - “Highest Valuation: Figure AI (Valued at $39 billion)”\n  - “Lowest price: 
Yushutech G1 ($16,000)”（应为 Unitree/宇树 G1）\n  - “Oldest: Boston Dynamics (over 30 years)”\n  - “Largest 
