"20260626215850788446_256c35e8", "type": "Claim", "text": "Industry analyses distinguish two main commercialization
routes for embodied humanoid robot companies: (1) a general‑purpose humanoid platform route, where once a common 
platform is validated, cross‑scenario replication leads to strong Matthew effects favoring scale players; and (2) a
vertical‑scenario specialist route, where firms first achieve a closed commercial loop in a single high‑value 
scenario, using cash flow and scenario data to reinforce core technology and then expand to other scenarios.", 
"source_ids": ["20260626215605001934_6406abb1"], "citations": [1]}, {"id": "20260626215850825999_da37272c", "type":
"Claim", "text": "Embodied intelligence (具身智能) is defined in Chinese research policy documents as AI fused with
physical entities, with robots identified as one of the hottest carriers, and humanoid robots and non‑humanoid 
robots classified as two major categories within robot‑focused embodied intelligence.", "source_ids": 
["20260626215605109794_ef9b568e", "20260626215605136169_0e908643"], "citations": [2, 3]}, {"id": 
"20260626215850909830_061e5657", "type": "Claim", "text": "Chinese national policy elevated embodied intelligence 
in 2025 by explicitly including “具身智能” in the State Council’s Government Work Report as part of the key future 
industries to be cultivated, supporting rapid domestic development under combined policy, technology, demand, and 
capital drivers.", "source_ids": ["20260626215605109794_ef9b568e", "20260626215605136169_0e908643"], "citations": 
[2, 3]}, {"id": "20260626215850971695_3f50d607", "type": "Claim", "text": "By 2026, Chinese embodied intelligence 
commercialization trends emphasize wheel‑type robots taking precedence, hybrid cloud–edge–endpoint architectures, 
and Robot‑as‑a‑Service (RaaS) or leasing models, with example RaaS implementations including Zhiyuan’s “Qingtian 
Rent” and Figure AI, while hardware sales models (e.g., Unitree, UBTECH) leverage scale to raise gross margins 
(Unitree’s near 60% gross margin).", "source_ids": ["20260626215605136169_0e908643", 
"20260626215605185150_c20c2a0d"], "citations": [3, 5]}, {"id": "20260626215851043410_0cb3a1cc", "type": "Claim", 
"text": "Industrial and commercial ecosystem initiatives in China include the Bicheng District–Galaxy General 
