deployments of embodied robots in industrial manufacturing and commercial service scenarios, alongside supply 
chain, pilot testing, and data‑collection infrastructure.", "source_ids": ["20260626215605214249_8d5ed96a"], 
"citations": [6]}, {"id": "20260626215851080774_36f96c0d", "type": "Claim", "text": "Unitree Robotics has expanded 
geographically by establishing a wholly owned subsidiary, Chongqing Yuyi Technology, in Dadukou District, 
