its position as a leading global legged and humanoid robot company.", "source_ids": 
["20260626215605214249_8d5ed96a"], "citations": [6]}, {"id": "20260626215851118517_4fe2e988", "type": "Claim", 
"text": "Forecasts from Chinese technology media and research institutes expect humanoid robots, as a major carrier
